            <div xml:id="d474-a3">

                <pb facs="0585" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg477"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 10.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tyler to Mr.
                            Esselstyn.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-10-22"><hi rendition="#italic">October 22,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: In reply to your letter just received,
                    I beg to express my regret at the insult and the assault to which you have been
                    subjected at the hands of a Persian boy, and at the same time to assure you that
                    I shall take steps to have the boy apprehended and exemplary chastisement
                    administered to him.</p>
                <p>I remain, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Tyler</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Interpreter in Charge.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
